1. Test Plan ID
TP-MANUAL-001

2. Project Name
VWO.com Login Module (or replace with your project name)

3. Introduction
This document outlines the test plan for manually testing the Login functionality of VWO.com. The goal is to verify that users can log in securely and effectively, ensuring all possible user scenarios are handled correctly.

4. Objectives and Tasks
Objectives:

To verify login page functionality with valid and invalid inputs

To ensure the system handles authentication failures securely

To identify defects prior to release

Tasks:

Review requirements

Design test cases

Execute test cases manually

Report and track bugs

Re-test after bug fixes

5. Scope
In Scope:

Functional testing of login module

UI validation

Error message validation

Browser compatibility for login flow

Out of Scope:

Backend/database testing

Performance or load testing

Two-factor authentication (if not implemented)

6. Test Strategy
Testing Type: Manual Functional Testing

Techniques Used: Black-box testing, Boundary value analysis

Tools Used: MS Excel, Google Sheets, Bug tracking tool (e.g., JIRA)

7. Test Deliverables
Test Plan Document

Test Cases Document

Bug Report

Final Test Summary Report

8. Test Environment
Web Application: VWO.com

Browsers: Chrome, Firefox, Edge

Devices: Desktop, Mobile

Network: Standard internet connection

